        "mission_intent": "Please have the internal audit team perform an aggregation analysis of all control deficiencies identified during this quarter's ICFR testing that impact the same significant financial statement account balances or disclosures. Specifically, we need to assess whether individual deficiencies that may not rise to the level of a material weakness on their own could, when taken together, collectively constitute a material weakness. For each cluster of related deficiencies, the team should evaluate the likelihood that a misstatement could occur by considering the nature of the controls involved and whether compensating controls exist, and should also evaluate the magnitude of potential misstatement by looking at the financial statement amounts and transaction volumes exposed to each deficiency. The analysis should cover all significant accounts and relevant assertions tested under AS 2201 and should be documented in a format suitable for discussion with our external auditors during the upcoming interim review. Please have the preliminary results ready for the Audit Committee's review by the end of next week, and flag any combinations that warrant escalation as potential material weaknesses.",
